"Keys                            1-18/203"
"Anywhere                                "
"  Ctrl+Z                                "
"    Suspend to the shell                "
"  Ctrl+L                                "
"    Redraw the screen                   "
"                                        "
"Transcript, also under a question       "
"  Ctrl+X                                "
"    Show or hide the todo panel         "
"  PgUp / PgDn                           "
"    Scroll the transcript a page        "
"  Shift+Up / Shift+Down                 "
"    Scroll the transcript a line        "
"  End                                   "
"    Jump back to the newest output when "
"    scrolled                            "
"  Mouse wheel                           "
"    Scroll the transcript               "
"j/k scroll  PgUp/PgDn page  q close     "
